{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026B1NPwkYKhs1794328728.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>2026年度邵逸夫獎舉行頒獎典禮。</p><p></p><p>生命科學與醫學獎的獲獎者為中國學者陳竺、法國學者安妮．德尚及戴宇閣，表彰他們發現開創協同標靶治療方案，醫治急性早幼粒細胞白血病。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SHAW-2130_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gdbTCOFBAc1794319584.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>日本學者野本憲一及美國學者斯坦福．伍斯利，憑對恆星爆炸及元素起源的研究，獲得天文學獎。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SHAW-2130_010.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hqdLqU2HjH1794319970.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>而數學科學獎，則由美國學者伊曼紐爾．康德斯，及卡米洛．德．雷列斯共享，表揚他們在運用深刻數學分析技術，解決重要應用方面取得的突破性貢獻。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SHAW-2130_.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026sf8WHgP4MX1794320147.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>頒獎典禮在灣仔會展進行，行政長官李家超亦有出席，他致辭中恭賀七名獲獎學者，又指政府未來會以科學為中心。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T17:24:29.025304+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":247,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T13:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T18:36:13.266177+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T17:17:48.789935+00:00","content_hash":"aa604889514bb49711f2213fdb7eb1c88d3a1dc14f6548d5b4bf093a9bd1744d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T17:24:29.025304+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}